      en: ["The plateau covers a forested area of approximately 100,000 hectares", "The highest points on the plateau exceed 580 meters in altitude", "Saint-Hubert is home to a basilica founded in the 11th century", "The region is famous for its large populations of red deer", "The rivers Lesse and Lomme originate in this plateau", "The plateau's climate is notably cooler than the surrounding lowlands"],
